Z||000011||RossT||06-27-2001||03:57 AM||||Looks like you need drip edges, and your weatherseal on the glass looks like it is cut down the middle! It should not have a slit all the way down.  They should be one piece.<P>I will take some pics and send them your way.<BR>Tim at <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroparts.com</A>  should have the drip edges and glass weatherseal.||||reg||1
